{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"He shakes his head. \"I am beginning to feel as though my efforts have been for naught. In my efforts to spare florian of the fate of losing a limb, I almost killed him. I may have even been making the hunger we're attempting to stave off stronger. I knew if it's nature, and yet I still believed I would be able to subdue it.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T15:36:24.142000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738057347733127169","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"I came on this journey in hopes to collect the blood of those related to the divine: dragonborn, aasimar. I thought if I could study that I could find the answer to our problem. Brew a potion to heal the gods.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T15:38:55.108000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738057980930424874","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Quite tha aspiration. What would ye do if ye din't have that?\" Kiln sips her coffee.","created_at":"2020-07-29T15:42:02.661000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738058767584854068","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"I don't know. I've been so absorbed in trying to find a way to save my lady. I only know how to preserve, not even able to properly heal like a cleric or other healer, I've attempted to learn the way of potions but even that eludes me.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T15:46:40.387000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738059932451995709","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"In't that our purpose? Ta preserve life? Ye may not be able ta heal, but ye can certainly do o'her works ta help people.\" She ponders for a moment. \"Besides tha gods can sort themselves out. We mortals need ta do what we can fer ourselves an each o'her.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T15:57:31.722000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738062664349122640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"(Navar will remember this)\n\"It's been a long journey. Every night I dream of my lady, and when I wake up she isn't there. Sometimes the dreams turn into that hunger twisting her creations into monstrosities tearing up the earth and the people that walk it.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T16:04:45.033000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738064481787183204","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
